      ],
      "text": "New severe HTN"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (⍉multifetal preg or molar dz): consider tests for 2/2 Eti such as renal a. stenosis, coarctation, Cushing syndrome, lupus and pheochromocytoma."
